.
.  Plot for figure 3.23
.
device 1 x11
device 1 font simplex
title displacement 4
title size 4
label size 4
tic mark label size 4
character size 4 all
title case asis
label case asis
tic mark label case asis
xtic offset units data
thickness 0.20
pre-erase off
.
.  Generate the data
.
read x y tag
0 0
1 0
2 0
0 1
1 1
2 1
0 2
1 2
2 2
end of data
let y2 = y - 0.2
let tag = sequence 1 1 9
line blank all
character circle 00 10 20 01 11 21 02 12 22
character fill on
let yoff = -0.3
limits 0 2
tic mark offset 0.75 0.75
major tic mark number 3
minor tic mark number 0
tic marks inside
x2frame off
y2frame off
x1label Factor A
y1label Factor B
.
erase
device 2 postscript
.
plot y x and
plot y2 x tag
.
. box 0 0 100 100
device 2 close
system cp dppl1f.dat fig323.ps
.
. quit
